            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 3,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的母亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哎呀，蕾！好久不见，最近还好吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720020",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072004,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 4,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "你一直都不怎么联系我们，我可是很担心的。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720030",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072005,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 5,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "好久不见。……抱歉，一直没怎么联系。/n我还是老样子，过得挺好的。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720040",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "404"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072006,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 6,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的母亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "真的？啊，对了！前阵子电视上那个剧团特辑我看了一点！/n里面拍到的那个是不是蕾？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720050",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072007,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 7,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯，碰巧而已。/n只拍到了一点点。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720060",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "404"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072008,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 8,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "你有好好昂首挺胸站在那里呢。很有蕾的样子。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720070",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072009,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 9,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "是、是吗？好难为情。/n那种东西，我自己不太会回头看的……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720080",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 6,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "404"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072010,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 10,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的母亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "妈妈啊，稍微放心了一点。/n觉得就算离开家，蕾也确实走在自己的路上。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720090",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "谢谢。不过我还差得远。/n以后还想更加努力。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720100",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
