            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 34,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "时间也差不多了。/n大家应该都累了，今天就到这里吧。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720310",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072035,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 35,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……也是。/n今天谢谢你们，还特意连线。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720320",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "404"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072036,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 36,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "好久没看到蕾的脸了，爸爸很高兴。看到你精神不错就放心了。/n学校和舞台工作两头跑，每天不会太辛苦吗？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720330",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072037,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 37,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "不会，我没事。/n学校和工作都有好好兼顾，所以每天都过得很充实。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720340",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
                    "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "404"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072038,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 38,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "那就好……。/n啊，还有，现在天气冷，可别感冒了。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720350",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072039,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 39,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯。你们那边也别勉强自己。/n也帮我跟妈妈说，要注意保暖。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720360",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "404"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072040,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 40,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾的父亲",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "好，我会转告她。/n……那就下次再聊，蕾。有什么事要马上给我们打电话啊。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720370",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072041,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 41,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "嗯，谢谢。……那，再见。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720380",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
                    "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "404"
        },
        {
            "Id": 142072042,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 142072,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 42,
            "SpeakerName": "蕾",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "妈妈和爸爸看起来都很有精神，真是太好了。/n……最近一直很忙，都没怎么联系。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1420720390",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
